1-\frac{3}{5}-\frac{2}{7}&=1-\frac{21}{35}-\frac{10}{35} \\
&=\frac{35}{35} - \frac{26}{35} \\
&=\frac{9}{35}
\end{align*} The fraction of the cookie left is $\boxed{\frac{9}{35}}$. </think> <answer> \frac{9}{35} </answer>

